e.\n- Supplies: pencils, scissors, tape, 5 envelopes per team (or folded paper) and a timer.\n- US Letter size; prints on A4 with &quot;Fit to page&quot;.\n- Good for Christmas break, family parties, classrooms and Christmas Eve.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nThis is a digital PDF download. Nothing is shipped. After purchase, download the file from your Etsy account (Purchases and reviews) or from the email Etsy sends you, then print at home or at a print shop. For personal and classroom use.\n\nThis design was created with AI assistance under the creative direction of the seller.", "rich_description": null, "state": "draft", "creation_timestamp": 1792862216, "created_timestamp": 1792862216, "ending_timestamp": 1803493016, "original_creation_timestamp": 1792862216, "last_modified_timestamp": 1792862309, "updated_timestamp": 1792862309, "state_timestamp": 1792862216, "quantity": 999, "shop_section_id": null, "featured_rank": -1, "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/4602402578/christmas-escape-room-for-kids-printable", "num_favorers": 0, "non_taxable": false, "is_taxable": true, "is_customizable": false, "is_personalizable": false, "listing_type": "download", "tags": ["xmas escape room", "kids escape room", "family escape room", "escape room game", "escape room kit", "holiday escape room", "christmas puzzles", "christmas party game", "kids christmas games", "christmas activity", "classroom christmas", "screen free activity", "family game night"], "materials": ["Digital download", "PDF"], "shipping_profile_id": null, "return_policy_id": 1, "processing_min": null, "processing_max": null, "who_made": "i_did", "when_made": "2020_2026", "is_supply": false, "item_weight": null, "item_weight_unit": null, "item_length": null, "item_width": null, "item_height": null, "item_dimensions_unit": null, "is_private": false, "style": [], "file_data": "1 PDF", "has_variations": false, "should_auto_renew": true, "language": "en-US", "price": {"amount": 1199, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, 